OL,3,GNEWSAWebsites taken down across Europe
OL,4,Aas critical cyber-security update
OL,5,Aissued
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Finnish government, Edinburgh
OL,8,Fcouncil and the BBC are among those to
OL,9,Fhave taken down sites and pages ahead
OL,10,Fof a software update to a programming
OL,11,Flanguage which underpins many online
OL,12,Fservices.
OL,14,FTwo critical vulnerabilities have been
OL,15,Ffound with the PHP programming
OL,16,Flanguage, which is widely used across
OL,17,Fthe internet. A fix was issued on
OL,18,FWednesday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
