OL,3,GNEWSAWebsites taken down across Europe
OL,4,Aas critical cyber-security update
OL,5,Aissued
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe flaws were discovered by AI, with
OL,8,Fcyber-security firm Wiz saying they
OL,9,Fwere the "most severe vulnerabilities
OL,10,Fever discovered" by the tech, which is
OL,11,Freshaping the cyber landscape.
OL,13,FMultiple national cyber-security
OL,14,Fagencies have urged organisations to
OL,15,Frapidly adopt the updates, or consider
OL,16,Ftaking their websites offline.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
